### ============================================================
### Testing Flow: Step-by-Step
### ============================================================

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 1: Organization API
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Create New Organization
### Save the returned organizationId for use in subsequent steps.
POST http://localhost:3000/organization
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationName": "Echo Corp",
  "initialBalance": 10000,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 1.2 Update Organization Balance
### Replace :organizationId with actual UUID from creation response.
PUT http://localhost:3000/organization/0fb06630-ec01-4257-ba71-0663271b1a0d
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "balance": 15000,
  "transactionKey": "tx-update-balance-456"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 2: Card API
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Create New Card
### Replace 'organizationId' with the one from Step 1.1.
POST http://localhost:3000/card
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "0fb06630-ec01-4257-ba71-0663271b1a0d",
  "cardNumber": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "dailyLimit": 1000,
  "monthlyLimit": 5000
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### STEP 3: Transaction API
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Create Transaction (Valid Checksum & Correlation ID)
### To generate a new checksum for different values, run:
###   npx ts-node calculate-checksum.ts
POST http://localhost:3000/transaction
Content-Type: application/json
x-organization-id: 0fb06630-ec01-4257-ba71-0663271b1a0d
x-checksum: c05d68deb6b71a4a21fd92b93c2c9ebb371ba590912308546b1a9f30ce83d543
x-correlation-id: my-correlation-id-789

{
  "organizationId": "0fb06630-ec01-4257-ba71-0663271b1a0d",
  "cardId": "f9155395-fcd4-4921-97a5-47661974af2d",
  "amount": 200.5,
  "transactionKey": "transaction-key-789"
}

### 3.2 Get Transaction Status
### Replace the UUID with the one returned from the creation request (3.1).
GET http://localhost:3000/transaction/61ca81ec-b287-437e-9cbd-fda45a92d283
Content-Type: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Edge Cases / Negative Tests
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### T1: Create Transaction (Missing Checksum - Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "0fb06630-ec01-4257-ba71-0663271b1a0d",
  "cardId": "f9155395-fcd4-4921-97a5-47661974af2d",
  "amount": 100.5,
  "transactionKey": "transaction-key-789"
}

### T2: Create Transaction (Invalid Checksum - Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/transaction
Content-Type: application/json
x-organization-id: 0fb06630-ec01-4257-ba71-0663271b1a0d
x-checksum: invalid-checksum-value
x-correlation-id: test-id-001

{
  "organizationId": "0fb06630-ec01-4257-ba71-0663271b1a0d",
  "cardId": "f9155395-fcd4-4921-97a5-47661974af2d",
  "amount": 100.5,
  "transactionKey": "transaction-key-789"
}
